@startuml
title Zoho Desk Monthly Ticket Automation - Architecture

actor "Windows Task Scheduler" as Scheduler
rectangle "PowerShell Runner" as Runner
rectangle "Python Automation" as Python
database "State File\n.zoho_monthly_tickets_state.json" as State
file "Ticket Config\ntickets.config.json" as Config
cloud "Zoho Accounts\nOAuth Refresh" as Accounts
cloud "Zoho Desk API\nTicket Create" as Desk
cloud "Telegram Bot API\nNotification" as Telegram

Scheduler --> Runner : monthly trigger
Runner --> Python : python zoho_monthly_tickets.py
Python --> Config : read due ticket templates
Python --> State : check duplicate status
Python --> Accounts : exchange refresh token
Accounts --> Python : access token
Python --> Desk : create due tickets
Python --> State : record created tickets
Python --> Telegram : send summary

@enduml

